","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_secondary_objective"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkt_s2_id","span_pkt_s2_title","span_pkt_s2_body","span_study_title","span_study_phase","span_study_region","span_study_purpose","span_population","span_inclusion","span_objectives","span_secondary_objective"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"heading":"研究背景和立项依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究拟在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中评价合成试验药A的有效性和安全性。目标人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者，入选要求包括年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，并适合接受系统治疗或光疗。本项研究为III期确证性研究，开发区域为中国，主要研究目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，次要研究目的为评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。上述研究人群、研究分期和研究目的构成本项确证性研究的立项基础。","rationale":"已确认事实支持本章写入适应症、目标人群、入排标准、研究分期、开发区域和研究目的。疾病流行病学、疾病负担、未满足临床需求和现行治疗现状缺少允许来源支持，需医学作者核对后补充，不应以推测事实替代。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0687d5113cc82a0a","section_number":"2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:56c0326daf4f1e844cace977","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025238_3603100e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["银屑病流行病学资料","中重度斑块状银屑病疾病负担资料","中重度斑块状银屑病现行治疗现状或指南来源","系统治疗或光疗的循证依据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认来源仅支持本研究的适应症为成人中重度斑块状银屑病及目标人群的严重程度和入选标准，缺少银屑病流行病学、疾病负担和中重度斑块状银屑病现行治疗现状来源，无法形成本章实质正文。需医学作者核对并补充相应来源后再撰写。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5f2555c78168de91","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:56c0326daf4f1e844cace977","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922025238_3603100e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"作用机制及同类药物研究进展","missing_source_classes":["研究药物作用机制研究资料","非临床药理毒理研究资料","同类小分子药物临床研究进展或既往临床资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认来源仅支持合成试验药A为小分子药物、口服给药，以及试验组100 mg每日一次连续16周、对照组匹配安慰剂的给药信息，缺少研究药物作用机制、非临床药理毒理资料和同类小分子药物研究进展，无法形成本章实质正文。需医学作者核对并补充相应来源后再撰写。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ec775a481341d056","section_number":"2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:56c0326daf4f1e844cace977","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:56c0326daf4f1e844cace977","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:56c0326daf4f1e844cace977","sour